# <type>(<scope>): <subject, imperative, no full stop, ~72 chars>

# Why this change was needed. The diff already shows what changed.

# Closes #

# feat     new behaviour a user can see
# fix      a defect in shipped behaviour
# docs     readme, contributing guide, changelog, comments
# test     tests only
# refactor no behaviour change
# perf     a measurable performance change
# build    bundling, packaging, tsconfig, dependencies
# ci       workflows and automation
# chore    anything else that touches no shipped behaviour
#
# scopes: scanner guard terminate inference eaddrinuse tree config deps
